OL,3,GNEWSABlanket 20mph speed limit for
OL,4,Acounty town scrapped
OL,5,
OL,6,FPlans to introduce a blanket 20mph
OL,7,Fspeed limit throughout Dorset's county
OL,8,Ftown have been scrapped following a
OL,9,Fpublic consultation.
OL,11,FMore than 3,800 people responded to the
OL,12,Fplans which were developed following
OL,13,Fconcerns from residents about vehicle
OL,14,Fspeeds and pedestrian safety.
OL,16,FDorchester Town Council said it would
OL,17,Fnot longer pursue the idea after 63% of
OL,18,Frespondents said they were opposed.
OL,20,FInstead, a feasibility study will
OL,21,Finstead look into implementing 20mph
OL,22,Fzones around schools.
OL,23,APub: 03-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
